        "v4_mem_how": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is a theINmag Membership and how does it work?",
            "answer": "<p>A theINmag Membership delivers a brand-new magazine made by real Australian kids three times a year, every February, June and October, with shipping included. Choose 4-Issue, 8-Issue or Rolling, in print or digital; current prices are on the <a href=\"/products/membership\" title=\"Membership page\">Membership page</a>. Pick which mag arrives first, and if an issue has sold out in print we skip it and you still get every mag you paid for. Members get theirs first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "v4_mem_cost": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much does theINmag cost?",
            "answer": "<p>A single print issue of theINmag is [single_print_price] and a digital issue is [single_digital_price]. Print Memberships are [m_print_4] for 4 issues, [m_print_8] for 8 issues or [m_print_rolling] per drop on Rolling, all with shipping included. Digital Memberships are [m_digital_4] for 4 issues, [m_digital_8] for 8 or [m_digital_rolling] per drop. The Digital Stack, every back issue as PDFs, is [stack_price]. Single issues ship at a flat rate, with free shipping over the threshold shown at checkout. All prices are in Australian dollars.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_09_i_only_meant_to_order_once_will_i_be_cha": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I only meant to order once. Will I be charged again automatically?",
            "answer": "<p>Only one of our <a href=\"/products/membership\">Memberships</a> ever charges again: the Rolling Membership. The 4-Issue and 8-Issue Memberships are paid upfront and never auto-renew, they simply finish when the last issue ships. We will email you to let you know if yours is lapsing. If you have a Rolling Membership, we email you a heads-up before each charge, and you can cancel anytime. Not sure which one you have? Email <a href=\"mailto:heyhey@theinmag.com.au\">heyhey@theinmag.com.au</a> and we will check for you in a jiffy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_10_i_bought_a_4_issue_or_8_issue_membership": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I bought a 4-issue or 8-issue membership but only got one magazine. Where are the rest?",
            "answer": "<p>They are coming, one at a time. theINmag comes out three times a year, in February, June and October, and your <a href=\"/products/membership\">Membership</a> delivers one mag per issue as each one drops. So a 4-Issue Membership arrives as four separate mags across about 16 months, not four mags in one parcel. Your child gets the fun of the postie four times over instead of once. Every issue you paid for will arrive.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_11_will_my_child_definitely_get_all_the_iss": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will my child definitely get all the issues I paid for?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, every single one. Your <a href=\"/products/membership\">Membership</a> covers a set number of issues, and each one is posted to you as it drops in February, June and October. Members get theirs first. If an issue ever goes missing in the post, email <a href=\"mailto:heyhey@theinmag.com.au\">heyhey@theinmag.com.au</a> and we will sort it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_12_is_a_membership_the_same_as_a_subscripti": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is a Membership the same as a subscription?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, a theINmag Membership is our magazine subscription: a brand-new issue three times a year, in February, June and October, in print or digital. We just call it a Membership. Only the Rolling Membership charges again. It is billed on the 1st of February, June and October with a heads-up email first, and you can cancel in two clicks from your account or by emailing us. The 4-Issue and 8-Issue Memberships are paid upfront, never auto-renew and simply finish when the last issue ships.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_13_what_s_the_difference_between_the_rollin": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the difference between the Rolling, 4-Issue and 8-Issue memberships?",
            "answer": "<p>The 4-Issue and 8-Issue <a href=\"/products/membership\">Memberships</a> are paid upfront for a fixed number of issues, with no auto-renewal. When the last issue ships, that is the end, nothing to cancel. The Rolling Membership auto-debits before each issue, with a heads-up email first, and you can cancel anytime. All three deliver one mag per drop, three times a year, and Members get theirs first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_14_how_do_i_cancel_my_membership": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I cancel my membership?",
            "answer": "<p>If you have a 4-Issue or 8-Issue <a href=\"/products/membership\" title=\"Membership\">Membership</a>, there is nothing to cancel. They are paid upfront, never auto-renew, and simply finish after the last issue. If you have a Rolling Membership, you can cancel anytime in two clicks from your account, or email <a href=\"mailto:heyhey@theinmag.com.au\">heyhey@theinmag.com.au</a> and we will take care of it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_15_my_membership_is_running_out_how_do_i_re": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "My membership is running out, how do I renew?",
            "answer": "<p>Easy. Just grab a new <a href=\"/products/membership\">Membership</a> on our website whenever suits you, and the next issues will keep coming. 4-Issue and 8-Issue Memberships finish on their own rather than auto-renewing, so renewing is always your choice. If you would rather never think about it, the Rolling Membership continues automatically with a heads-up email before each issue. Not sure when your current one ends? Email <a href=\"mailto:heyhey@theinmag.com.au\">heyhey@theinmag.com.au</a> and we will look it up.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_16_how_often_does_the_magazine_come_out_how": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How often does the magazine come out? How many issues a year?",
            "answer": "<p>Three issues a year, in February, June and October. We wait for kids' creations to come in, and the three-a-year rhythm works beautifully. Each issue is posted on the 10th of its month and usually arrives around the 15th. Members get theirs first and never miss an issue.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_17_what_if_my_kid_already_has_the_current_i": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if my kid already has the current issue? Can we start with the next one?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, that is exactly what the \"start with the next issue\" option is for. You skip the issue your kid already has, and your <a href=\"/products/membership\">Membership</a> begins with the next drop. The price is the same either way, so there is no extra cost to wait.</p>"
          }
        },
        "v4_mem_refund": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the refund policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We investigate and replace damaged or missing mags. Change-of-mind returns are not accepted on printed single issues, because return postage would exceed the price. For Memberships, shipped issues are not refundable, but unshipped issues can be cancelled and refunded pro rata. Digital mags are delivered instantly so are not refundable, except if you bought digital by mistake instead of print: buy print, email us, and the digital is refunded.</p>"
          }
        },
